OL,3,GNEWSANHS boss received nearly #400,000
OL,4,A'redundancy' pay-off when she retired
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS executive has received a near
OL,7,F#400,000 redundancy pay-off after
OL,8,Fretiring from a health board, new
OL,9,Ffigures show.
OL,11,FFollowing a 44-year career in the
OL,12,Fhealth service, Mary Morgan retired as
OL,13,Fchief executive of NHS National
OL,14,FServices Scotland (NSS) in May.
OL,16,FBut it has now been revealed Morgan
OL,17,Freceived a #378,000 payment "under
OL,18,Fcontractual redundancy terms" as part
OL,19,Fof an exit that came after NHS NSS was
OL,20,Fmerged into a new quango called Public
OL,21,FServices Delivery (PSD) Scotland in
OL,22,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
