OL,3,GNEWSANHS boss received nearly #400,000
OL,4,A'redundancy' pay-off when she retired
OL,5,
OL,6,FA PSD Scotland spokesperson said Morgan
OL,7,Fretired after an "exceptional career"
OL,8,Fand all payments were in accordance
OL,9,Fwith the terms and conditions of her
OL,10,Femployment.
